WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:05.680
In this video, we'll show you how to

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:07.680
install Tessle onto your machine. You

3
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:10.320
will need to download the Tessle CLI,

4
00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:14.160
which can be done using npm. You'll need

5
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:18.160
a node version 22 or higher.

6
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:20.880
At a terminal, run npm install-g

7
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:23.119
at tesli.

8
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:25.600
You can test the CLI installation by

9
00:00:23.119 --> 00:00:28.560
running the command tessle-help

10
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.480
to check that everything is working.

11
00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.000
You should now have a working Tessle

12
00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:34.320
installation.

13
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.520
Your next step is to initialize Tessle

14
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.520
in a project.
